Scientific developments
In 1822, a stork was killed in Germany which had an African spear in its ___
Previously there had been no ___ that storks migrate to Africa.
Little was known about the ___ and journeys of migrating birds until the practice of ringing was established.
It was thought large birds carried small birds on some journeys because they were considered incapable of travelling across huge ___
Ringing depended on what is called the ___ of dead birds.
In 1931, the first ___ to show the migration of European birds was printed.

